      "content": "i know i should call them but it's like 2am and they won't answer. i dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's so expensive. i'm pretty sure i just need to level it out since it was 180 just a bit ago. if i just take 1 or 2 units of my fast acting stuff, won't that fix the spike so i can sleep? it feels safer than just sitting here feeling dizzy.",
